{
  "name": "vereinsmanager",
  "private": true,
  "version": "0.9.0",
  "description": "DSGVO-konforme, revisionssichere Vereinsverwaltung für gemeinnützige Vereine (e.V.) in Deutschland.",
  "license": "UNLICENSED",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/alpenglowsea/vereinsmanager.git"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "scripts": {
    "dev": "tsx server.ts",
    "build": "vite build && esbuild server.ts --bundle --platform=node --format=cjs --packages=external --sourcemap --outfile=dist/server.cjs",
    "build:ui": "vite build",
    "start": "node dist/server.cjs",
    "preview": "vite preview",
    "tauri": "tauri",
    "clean": "node -e \"const fs=require('fs');fs.rmSync('dist',{recursive:true,force:true});fs.rmSync('server.js',{force:true})\"",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "typecheck:strict": "tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.strict.json",
    "lint": "eslint .",
    "lint:fix": "eslint . --fix",
    "format": "prettier --write .",
    "format:check": "prettier --check .",
    "test": "vitest run",
    "test:watch": "vitest",
    "test:coverage": "vitest run --coverage",
    "check": "npm run typecheck && npm run lint && npm run test"
  },
  "//dependencies": [
    "Hier stehen NUR die Pakete, die der fertige Server zur Laufzeit",
    "wirklich lädt — also die vier, die server.ts importiert, plus",
    "compression. Alles andere gehört unter devDependencies, auch React",
    "und die Oberflächen-Pakete: Vite baut daraus beim 'npm run build'",
    "fertiges JavaScript, das im Ordner dist/ landet. Danach wird das",
    "Paket selbst nie wieder gebraucht.",
    "",
    "Der Unterschied ist im Docker-Image zu sehen: Dort läuft",
    "'npm ci --omit=dev', das genau diese Liste hier installiert. Standen",
    "React, jspdf, lucide-react und Tailwind mit in dieser Liste, wanderten",
    "gut 150 MB unnötig in das Image.",
    "",
    "Zum Entwickeln ändert sich nichts: 'npm install' und 'npm ci' holen",
    "immer beide Listen."
  ],
  "dependencies": {
    "@google/genai": "^2.4.0",
    "compression": "^1.7.4",
    "dotenv": "^17.2.3",
    "express": "^4.21.2",
    "nodemailer": "^10.0.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@eslint/js": "^10.0.1",
    "@supabase/supabase-js": "^2.112.3",
    "@tailwindcss/vite": "^4.1.14",
    "@tauri-apps/cli": "^2",
    "@types/compression": "^1.7.5",
    "@types/express": "^4.17.21",
    "@types/node": "^22.14.0",
    "@types/nodemailer": "^8.0.1",
    "@types/papaparse": "^5.5.2",
    "@types/qrcode": "^1.5.6",
    "@types/react": "^19.3.0",
    "@types/react-dom": "^19.3.0",
    "@vitejs/plugin-react": "^5.0.4",
    "@vitest/coverage-v8": "^5.0.1",
    "autoprefixer": "^10.4.21",
    "esbuild": "^0.25.0",
    "eslint": "^10.10.0",
    "eslint-config-prettier": "^10.1.8",
    "eslint-plugin-react-hooks": "^7.1.1",
    "globals": "^17.12.0",
    "jspdf": "^4.2.1",
    "jspdf-autotable": "^5.0.8",
    "lucide-react": "^0.546.0",
    "papaparse": "^5.6.0",
    "prettier": "^3.9.7",
    "qrcode": "^1.5.4",
    "react": "^19.0.1",
    "react-dom": "^19.0.1",
    "tailwindcss": "^4.1.14",
    "tsx": "^4.21.0",
    "typescript": "~5.8.2",
    "typescript-eslint": "^8.70.0",
    "vite": "^6.2.3",
    "vitest": "^5.0.1"
  }
}
